abstract: >
  FSM-Bench-20 is a reproducible benchmark of 20 natural-language requirement
  specifications for evaluating open-source LLMs on deterministic finite state
  machine generation under local Ollama inference. The artifact includes the
  dataset, prompt specification, FSM JSON schema, evaluation scripts, and a
  completed 140-run campaign freeze (manifest 20260602T195520Z) with headline
  nested gate rates G1 98.6%, G2 78.6%, and G3 31.4%.
